sentences.text:
Appeal merits consideration, in the result, the following:
ORDER (i) Appeal is allowed;
(ii) Impugned judgment and award is modified;
P. Ravi vs D. Lakshmana Naik on 13 August, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/141366381/
3 NC: 2024:KHC:32449 (iii) Both respondents No.1 and 2 are jointly liable to pay the compensation to the petitioners;
(iv) Insurance Company is directed to deposit the compensation with interest at 6% p.a. from the date of petition till the date of deposit; and (v) Amount in deposit, if any, shall be returned to the appellant.

